          "en": "there are two additional components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.68,
          "end": 21.78,
          "en": "I want to create in this project here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.78,
          "end": 23.31,
          "en": "And most importantly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.31,
          "end": 26.85,
          "en": "there are a couple of other crucial React features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.85,
          "end": 27.78,
          "en": "you should know about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.78,
          "end": 29.85,
          "en": "and we'll dive into those features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.85,
          "end": 33.12,
          "en": "as we'll build those additional components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.12,
          "end": 37.95,
          "en": "And I'll start here in the core concepts JSX file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.95,
          "end": 40.59,
          "en": "In there, we got this section element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.59,
          "end": 43.62,
          "en": "which then inside of it has this title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.62,
          "end": 46.91,
          "en": "and then the actual content of that section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.91,
          "end": 49.2,
          "en": "In this case, this list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.2,
          "end": 52.41,
          "en": "And we have a similar JSX structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.41,
          "end": 55.62,
          "en": "in the examples JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.62,
          "end": 59.76,
          "en": "There we also have a section with a title inside of it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.76,
          "end": 62.1,
          "en": "and then some content inside of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.1,
          "end": 65.193,
          "en": "In this case, the tab buttons and the tab content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.36,
          "end": 68.43,
          "en": "Now here, we could therefore build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.43,
          "end": 71.1,
          "en": "a separate section component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.1,
          "end": 74.49,
          "en": "that always enforces this structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.49,
          "end": 77.78999999999999,
          "en": "so that make sure that we always have such a title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.78999999999999,
          "end": 80.03999999999999,
          "en": "and then some content below it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.03999999999999,
          "end": 82.44,
          "en": "Because as our application might grow,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.44,
          "end": 85.14,
          "en": "we might be adding more and more sections",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.14,
          "end": 86.34100000000001,
          "en": "and chances are high",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.34100000000001,
          "end": 89.78999999999999,
          "en": "that we'll always have this kind of structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.78999999999999,
          "end": 92.88,
          "en": "where we have title and then some content below it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.88,
          "end": 95.64,
          "en": "and then probably the section element being used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.64,
          "end": 98.4,
          "en": "to wrap that overall content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.4,
          "end": 99.6,
          "en": "And therefore, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.6,
          "end": 101.66,
          "en": "we could add an additional component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 101.66,
          "end": 105.9,
          "en": "in the components folder and name it section.JSX",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.9,
          "end": 109.22999999999999,
          "en": "or name the file section.JSX.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.22999999999999,
          "end": 110.55,
          "en": "And then inside of there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 110.55,
          "end": 115.32,
          "en": "we can export a section component function, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.32,
          "end": 118.83,
          "en": "Now in here, we then could return our section element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 118.83,
          "end": 121.56,
          "en": "and the h2 element inside of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 121.56,
          "end": 124.65,
          "en": "And the title should then be set dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.65,
          "end": 126.3,
          "en": "with help of props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 126.3,
          "end": 128.25,
          "en": "since it should be configurable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.25,
          "end": 132.75,
          "en": "in the place where this section component is being used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 132.75,
          "end": 136.32,
          "en": "So therefore, we can use props destructuring here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 136.32,
          "end": 137.52,
          "en": "as you learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 137.52,
          "end": 141.57,
          "en": "and expect to get a title prop, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 141.57,
          "end": 145.14,
          "en": "so that here we can then use and output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 145.14,
          "end": 147.243,
          "en": "this title prop like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 148.68,
          "end": 150.48,
          "en": "And then of course, we can also get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 150.48,
          "end": 152.64,
          "en": "the special children prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 152.64,
          "end": 154.988,
          "en": "so that we can use our section component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 154.988,
          "end": 157.14,
          "en": "our custom component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 157.14,
          "end": 161.07,
          "en": "as a wrapper around the actual section content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 161.07,
          "end": 163.29,
          "en": "that should go below this title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 163.29,
          "end": 165.32999999999998,
          "en": "because we can then use this children prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 165.32999999999998,
          "end": 167.523,
          "en": "to output it here below the title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 168.69,
          "end": 171.32999999999998,
          "en": "And building a component like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 171.32999999999998,
          "end": 173.46,
          "en": "then allows us to use it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 173.46,
          "end": 176.553,
          "en": "For example, in this examples JSX file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 177.6,
          "end": 181.38,
          "en": "In there, here where we import our components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 181.38,
          "end": 182.79,
          "en": "and other things,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 182.79,
          "end": 185.07,
          "en": "we can import this section component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 185.07,
          "end": 188.373,
          "en": "from ./Section JSX.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 190.05,
          "end": 193.92,
          "en": "And with that imported, we can go down here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 193.92,
          "end": 198.92000000000002,
          "en": "and now replace this section here with our custom section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 200.73,
          "end": 202.893,
          "en": "and also the closing tag, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 204.42000000000002,
          "end": 205.44,
          "en": "And with that done,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 205.44,
          "end": 209.07,
          "en": "we now no longer add the h2 element like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 209.07,
          "end": 212.82,
          "en": "Instead, now, we can set this special title prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 212.82,
          "end": 215.77,
          "en": "which we're expecting here in this section component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 215.77,
          "end": 219.63,
          "en": "And therefore, here in this examples JSX file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 219.63,
          "end": 222.15,
          "en": "we can set the title prop on section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 222.15,
          "end": 224.973,
          "en": "and in this case, set it to examples.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 227.34,
          "end": 229.8,
          "en": "Now if we do that and save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 229.8,
          "end": 231.39,
          "en": "you'll notice that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 231.39,
          "end": 235.41,
          "en": "the styling doesn't look correct anymore, though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 235.41,
          "end": 238.413,
          "en": "For example, these buttons are now broken.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 239.46,
          "end": 242.16,
          "en": "And the reason for that of course is that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 242.16,
          "end": 247.08,
          "en": "I got some styling rules in this index CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 247.08,
          "end": 251.19,
          "en": "where I'm looking for the examples ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 251.19,
          "end": 253.83,
          "en": "I want that ID on an element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 253.83,
          "end": 256.26,
          "en": "to then style the overall element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 256.26,
          "end": 259.953,
          "en": "but also some child elements like the h2 tag or the menu.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 261.09,
          "end": 263.61,
          "en": "And whilst I'm setting the ID here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 263.61,
          "end": 266.19,
          "en": "on my custom section component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 266.19,
          "end": 270.153,
          "en": "I'm not using this ID prop inside of this section component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 271.2,
          "end": 274.74,
          "en": "And what's really important to understand here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 274.74,
          "end": 277.26,
          "en": "and in React in general",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 277.26,
          "end": 280.5,
          "en": "is that when you are setting props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 280.5,
          "end": 283.74,
          "en": "so attributes, so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 283.74,
          "end": 286.23,
          "en": "on a custom component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 286.23,
          "end": 291.21,
          "en": "those props are not automatically forwarded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 291.21,
          "end": 295.233,
          "en": "to the JSX code used inside of that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 296.73,
          "end": 300.21,
          "en": "So, here in this case, the ID prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 300.21,
          "end": 303.69,
          "en": "which we're setting on our custom section component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 303.69,
          "end": 306.57,
          "en": "in the examples JSX file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 306.57,
          "end": 309.99,
          "en": "this prop is not automatically forwarded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 309.99,
          "end": 314.31,
          "en": "and set as an attribute on this built-in section element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 314.31,
          "end": 318.18,
          "en": "that we're using inside of our custom component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 318.18,
          "end": 320.79,
          "en": "There is no magic connection like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 320.79,
          "end": 325.47,
          "en": "Instead, React is only setting the props on the elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 325.47,
          "end": 328.47,
          "en": "where you, the developer are setting them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 328.47,
          "end": 332.043,
          "en": "There is no magic going on behind the scenes regarding that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 333.3,
          "end": 335.55,
          "en": "And therefore, here at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 335.55,
          "end": 340.11,
          "en": "this ID prop, which we're setting here in examples JSX",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 340.11,
          "end": 343.86,
          "en": "is basically just lost, it's ignored by React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 343.86,
          "end": 346.14,
          "en": "It's not there in the rendered DOM",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 346.14,
          "end": 348.663,
          "en": "and that's why those styles are lost.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 350.28,
          "end": 352.86,
          "en": "Now, of course, we could now try to destructure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 352.86,
          "end": 354.27,
          "en": "this ID prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 354.27,
          "end": 356.163,
          "en": "and then added like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 357.57,
          "end": 359.15999999999997,
          "en": "That would work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 359.15999999999997,
          "end": 362.58,
          "en": "If we save that, you see the styling spec.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 362.58,
          "end": 364.56,
          "en": "But when using this approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 364.56,
          "end": 366.315,
          "en": "we would have to destructure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 366.315,
          "end": 370.11,
          "en": "and manually set more and more attributes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 370.11,
          "end": 372.48,
          "en": "on this built-in section element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 372.48,
          "end": 375.39,
          "en": "if we want to set more elements here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 375.39,
          "end": 378.3,
          "en": "For example, if we also want to set a class name here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 378.3,
          "end": 380.1,
          "en": "to add a CSS class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 380.1,
          "end": 384.3,
          "en": "We also would have to destructure that here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 384.3,
          "end": 387.72,
          "en": "and then manually set it like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 387.72,
          "end": 390.42,
          "en": "on this built-in section element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 390.42,
          "end": 394.23,
          "en": "And this is not really scalable and not really convenient.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 394.23,
          "end": 398.49,
          "en": "Therefore, here, we can use a pattern that could be called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 398.49,
          "end": 402.513,
          "en": "forwarded props or proxy props.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}